  "conclusion": "The pinned source exposes useful adjacent hooks but no single source seam joins v5 attempt identity through committed effects, frozen bank, exact block position, and rooted fork. This map is feasibility evidence only; no runtime law, persistence/finality, candidate-position, native settlement, buyExact25, PIT, economic admission, or completeness claim follows.",
